<title>USA: U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. weekly national grain stocks by region - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>PORTLAND 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>National stocks of grain, in thousand bushels, as reported by the USDA.</p>
<p>		   Wheat   Corn  Soybeans Pct filled</p>
<p> Atlantic cst    4493    417     354    53</p>
<p> Great Lakes    25210    331     740    15</p>
<p> River Points   18459   1745    3870    16</p>
<p> Southwest	19276   1991     213    15</p>
<p> Gulf Points    23113   3846    2236    34</p>
<p> Plains Area    39081   5136	42    19</p>
<p> Pacific NW     10604    944     unq    37</p>
<p> Grand Total   140236  14410    7455    20</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk 312-983-7278--</p>
